    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/da53aa0d1d5f490a0aca1265a473bb36.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Glade is a 2D simulation role-playing video game set in a fantastic world</strong> of mysteries and unexplored worlds. Go on a new adventure together with Tobi. Build your new home, study the causes and consequences of the <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>, discover new forms of life, and follow your goal.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1527017b9180762ed0a2ad229e05b9c9.avif?t=1740590647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a17a1eddb3df30de8f5cf7991c175d42.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tobi</strong> was a professor at the <strong>Branafotz Magical Academy</strong> in the kingdom of <strong>Winterlake</strong>, he imparted knowledge of Magical creatures to his students. He told them how to study, search, and above all <strong>how not to harm</strong> the wide variety of creatures that inhabited their kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He also dispelled the myth of people</strong> that all magical creatures aren\u2019t smart and have <strong>no feelings and emotions</strong>, The professor tried to protect habitats, which were gradually taken over by various <strong>Lords and Kings.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=630 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.mp4?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>One day Tobi was writing his new research paper</strong> when suddenly he heard a rumor that on the shore of the <strong>big lake Moro</strong>, which is far to the East in the no-man's land there was a <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>. Not many people live in that region, but there is a large variety of different creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of them prefer to <strong>hide in the forests</strong> and rarely come to people. Tobi decides to immediately go to the place of the incident, <strong>collect everything necessary for the road</strong>, and from this moment begins a new <strong>exciting adventure into the depths of no man's land</strong>, he will look for clues and study new races <strong>to find answers</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.mp4?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/320dfe09bf28c7255f5f1082605c20db.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make your journey easier and your <strong>exploration more successful</strong>, you'll need to <strong>improve your new home</strong> and <strong>build relationships with the locals.</strong> A large number of different<strong> tools and game mechanics</strong> will help you with this. Collect various resources that will help you <strong>create items or earn Orni gold coins</strong>. Plant different types of <strong>plants</strong> and then <strong>harvest</strong> them. You can use the <strong>vegetables</strong> to make food that will give <strong>Tobi energy to travel.</strong> If you help the locals, they will <strong>support you on your journey</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting Wood</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a21f83931ac459678d286699b5e93630.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a21f83931ac459678d286699b5e93630.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>axe</strong> will help you chop and harvest wood, with it you can <strong>craft new</strong> <strong>tools</strong>, various useful items and furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stone Mining</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/6c300e83cc3ca421543a5de70b1c10ca.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/6c300e83cc3ca421543a5de70b1c10ca.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The <strong>pickaxe</strong> will allow you to <strong>clear your way</strong>, collect various <strong>ores and minerals</strong>, all of which you can process on the <strong>workbench and in the furnaces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning bushes and flowers for crops</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3aa84f650f79ed01a8997cd9d3fbb3a3.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3aa84f650f79ed01a8997cd9d3fbb3a3.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use a <strong>scythe</strong> to clear a space for your plants from <strong>bushes, weeds, and flowers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land preparation for planting</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/5e0a043f2c3515fe2050121aed78b23b.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/5e0a043f2c3515fe2050121aed78b23b.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Using a <strong>hoe</strong> you will be able to make a hole for the <strong>seeds of your chosen plant.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planting Seeds</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9c2f2c7c3d54a03de1291eb09faf5922.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9c2f2c7c3d54a03de1291eb09faf5922.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Plant your chosen seeds</strong> in the prepared soil, in<strong> 5 days</strong> you will be able <strong>to harvest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watering seedlingss</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/847190169705ae58181f70e0c00d8592.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/847190169705ae58181f70e0c00d8592.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Do not forget to water</strong> your seedlings, <strong>without water the growth will slow</strong> <strong>down </strong>and there is a chance that they will not grow at all. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvesting</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/17d1ce0cff7dd020649cbb8091ddb0e5.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/17d1ce0cff7dd020649cbb8091ddb0e5.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>After 5 days</strong>, harvest your crops and <strong>enjoy your work.</strong> The produce can be sold to merchants or cooked into various dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction system\ud83d\udd27</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/904cbe8923061744b082a495545dd62a.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/904cbe8923061744b082a495545dd62a.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <strong>Build your new home</strong> and make it <strong>absolutely unique.</strong> Use <strong>decorative and functional</strong> objects to create a <strong>wonderful space.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night system</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/7ff270e5fd26733034323d4531929a8b.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/7ff270e5fd26733034323d4531929a8b.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialog system \ud83d\udcdc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1104dabb0df343d42368cf2e66ac106d.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1104dabb0df343d42368cf2e66ac106d.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive <strong>system of dialogues</strong> will help you learn more about the<strong> world, its inhabitants</strong>, and what happened during the <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>. By improving your relationships, you discover new opportunities for research, items, and storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather system\ud83c\udf1c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3066d001564fb759ad3703cd7adb0a20.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3066d001564fb759ad3703cd7adb0a20.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>rain or fog</strong>, Tobi can find<strong> rare</strong> plants and resources that are highly valued by traders who are willing to <strong>pay generously</strong> for them. Or these items can be used to create<strong> first-class tools</strong> that will be indispensable in an <strong>adventure</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/da53aa0d1d5f490a0aca1265a473bb36.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Glade is a 2D simulation role-playing video game set in a fantastic world</strong> of mysteries and unexplored worlds. Go on a new adventure together with Tobi. Build your new home, study the causes and consequences of the <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>, discover new forms of life, and follow your goal.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1527017b9180762ed0a2ad229e05b9c9.avif?t=1740590647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a17a1eddb3df30de8f5cf7991c175d42.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tobi</strong> was a professor at the <strong>Branafotz Magical Academy</strong> in the kingdom of <strong>Winterlake</strong>, he imparted knowledge of Magical creatures to his students. He told them how to study, search, and above all <strong>how not to harm</strong> the wide variety of creatures that inhabited their kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He also dispelled the myth of people</strong> that all magical creatures aren\u2019t smart and have <strong>no feelings and emotions</strong>, The professor tried to protect habitats, which were gradually taken over by various <strong>Lords and Kings.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=630 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9af2c22b8999bada7c5df7fd46b10ba8.mp4?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>One day Tobi was writing his new research paper</strong> when suddenly he heard a rumor that on the shore of the <strong>big lake Moro</strong>, which is far to the East in the no-man's land there was a <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>. Not many people live in that region, but there is a large variety of different creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of them prefer to <strong>hide in the forests</strong> and rarely come to people. Tobi decides to immediately go to the place of the incident, <strong>collect everything necessary for the road</strong>, and from this moment begins a new <strong>exciting adventure into the depths of no man's land</strong>, he will look for clues and study new races <strong>to find answers</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/912a558da122c708d60801c631fa6661.mp4?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/320dfe09bf28c7255f5f1082605c20db.avif?t=1740590647\" width=565 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make your journey easier and your <strong>exploration more successful</strong>, you'll need to <strong>improve your new home</strong> and <strong>build relationships with the locals.</strong> A large number of different<strong> tools and game mechanics</strong> will help you with this. Collect various resources that will help you <strong>create items or earn Orni gold coins</strong>. Plant different types of <strong>plants</strong> and then <strong>harvest</strong> them. You can use the <strong>vegetables</strong> to make food that will give <strong>Tobi energy to travel.</strong> If you help the locals, they will <strong>support you on your journey</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting Wood</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a21f83931ac459678d286699b5e93630.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/a21f83931ac459678d286699b5e93630.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>axe</strong> will help you chop and harvest wood, with it you can <strong>craft new</strong> <strong>tools</strong>, various useful items and furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stone Mining</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/6c300e83cc3ca421543a5de70b1c10ca.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/6c300e83cc3ca421543a5de70b1c10ca.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The <strong>pickaxe</strong> will allow you to <strong>clear your way</strong>, collect various <strong>ores and minerals</strong>, all of which you can process on the <strong>workbench and in the furnaces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning bushes and flowers for crops</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3aa84f650f79ed01a8997cd9d3fbb3a3.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3aa84f650f79ed01a8997cd9d3fbb3a3.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use a <strong>scythe</strong> to clear a space for your plants from <strong>bushes, weeds, and flowers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land preparation for planting</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/5e0a043f2c3515fe2050121aed78b23b.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/5e0a043f2c3515fe2050121aed78b23b.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Using a <strong>hoe</strong> you will be able to make a hole for the <strong>seeds of your chosen plant.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planting Seeds</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9c2f2c7c3d54a03de1291eb09faf5922.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/9c2f2c7c3d54a03de1291eb09faf5922.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Plant your chosen seeds</strong> in the prepared soil, in<strong> 5 days</strong> you will be able <strong>to harvest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watering seedlingss</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/847190169705ae58181f70e0c00d8592.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/847190169705ae58181f70e0c00d8592.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Do not forget to water</strong> your seedlings, <strong>without water the growth will slow</strong> <strong>down </strong>and there is a chance that they will not grow at all. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvesting</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/17d1ce0cff7dd020649cbb8091ddb0e5.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/17d1ce0cff7dd020649cbb8091ddb0e5.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>After 5 days</strong>, harvest your crops and <strong>enjoy your work.</strong> The produce can be sold to merchants or cooked into various dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction system\ud83d\udd27</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/904cbe8923061744b082a495545dd62a.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/904cbe8923061744b082a495545dd62a.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <strong>Build your new home</strong> and make it <strong>absolutely unique.</strong> Use <strong>decorative and functional</strong> objects to create a <strong>wonderful space.\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night system</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/7ff270e5fd26733034323d4531929a8b.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/7ff270e5fd26733034323d4531929a8b.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialog system \ud83d\udcdc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1104dabb0df343d42368cf2e66ac106d.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/1104dabb0df343d42368cf2e66ac106d.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive <strong>system of dialogues</strong> will help you learn more about the<strong> world, its inhabitants</strong>, and what happened during the <strong>magical cataclysm</strong>. By improving your relationships, you discover new opportunities for research, items, and storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather system\ud83c\udf1c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3066d001564fb759ad3703cd7adb0a20.poster.avif?t=1740590647\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587320/extras/3066d001564fb759ad3703cd7adb0a20.webm?t=1740590647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>rain or fog</strong>, Tobi can find<strong> rare</strong> plants and resources that are highly valued by traders who are willing to <strong>pay generously</strong> for them. Or these items can be used to create<strong> first-class tools</strong> that will be indispensable in an <strong>adventure</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hidden Glade is a 2D simulation role-playing video game set in a fantastic world of mysteries and unexplored worlds. Go on a new adventure together with Tobi. Develop your new home, find answers to your questions and go to your goal.",
